;
; How Relief files one mesh in MYRA (relief_rules.h RR6): the mesh's
; number, how many vertices and faces it holds and when it was saved (Unix
; seconds). Relief asks whether the numbers fit before it lists them.
^ZXRELIEF(mesh:i9) = vertices:i3! ^ faces:i4! ^ mtime:i12!
